{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01647","headline":"杂曲歌辞 白马篇 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 白马篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙马花雪毛，金鞍五陵豪。\n秋霜切玉劒，落日明珠袍。\n鬬鸡事万乘，轩盖一何高。\n弓摧宜山虎，手接泰山猱。\n酒後竞风彩，三杯弄宝刀。\n杀人如翦草，剧孟同游遨。\n发愤去函谷，从军向临洮。\n叱咤万战场，匈奴尽波涛。\n归来使酒气，未肯拜萧曹。\n羞入原宪室，荒径隐蓬蒿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}